# Generated API sheets (quartz-ctx `generate` writes here).
# Scoped to the crates that produce them: a bare `docs/` also swallows this
# repo's own documentation folder, silently — which is how docs/GRAPHIFY.md got
# written, committed and pushed as nothing at all.
cortex/docs/
quartz-ctx/docs/

# Graphify output — regenerate with `graphify-rs build`
.graphify-output/
